WEBVTT

0
00:00:06.730 --> 00:00:10.539
Implementation is where the instruction finally meets its learners.

1
00:00:10.890 --> 00:00:11.760
The environment,

2
00:00:12.090 --> 00:00:12.640
materials,

3
00:00:13.289 --> 00:00:13.489
technology,

4
00:00:13.569 --> 00:00:14.829
and support systems

5
00:00:15.130 --> 00:00:18.450
all come together here to set learners up for success,

6
00:00:18.760 --> 00:00:20.629
launching the instruction

7
00:00:20.930 --> 00:00:22.059
with everything ready,

8
00:00:22.209 --> 00:00:25.000
the course or training officially goes live.

9
00:00:25.370 --> 00:00:27.530
Learners get access to the materials,

10
00:00:27.610 --> 00:00:28.250
activities,

11
00:00:28.290 --> 00:00:29.389
and assessments

12
00:00:29.750 --> 00:00:32.290
along with anything else they need to get started,

13
00:00:32.720 --> 00:00:35.290
preparing learners and facilitators.

14
00:00:35.880 --> 00:00:37.159
Before things kick off,

15
00:00:37.380 --> 00:00:39.520
learners are walked through what to expect,

16
00:00:39.880 --> 00:00:40.330
schedules,

17
00:00:40.889 --> 00:00:41.020
technology,

18
00:00:41.139 --> 00:00:42.130
available resources,

19
00:00:42.169 --> 00:00:43.580
and how the course works.

20
00:00:43.970 --> 00:00:46.009
Facilitators get their own prep too,

21
00:00:46.380 --> 00:00:50.060
so they're comfortable with the content and ready to guide learners through it.

22
00:00:50.540 --> 00:00:52.779
Providing support and monitoring

23
00:00:53.029 --> 00:00:54.310
once the course is underway,

24
00:00:54.430 --> 00:00:56.180
it's about staying attentive,

25
00:00:56.509 --> 00:00:59.049
keeping an eye on participation and progress,

26
00:00:59.389 --> 00:01:01.700
and stepping in quickly when technical issues,

27
00:01:02.069 --> 00:01:02.229
questions,

28
00:01:02.270 --> 00:01:03.819
or other challenges come up

29
00:01:04.110 --> 00:01:05.970
so learners can keep moving forward.